IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} capisco.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Che peccato!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Facciamo un'altra volta, quando
hai più tempo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}d'accordo?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu as atteint la sortie in extremis !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Comme tu as fait trois tentatives,
je te dois {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0009:0100}} clochettes{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Jippie! Also los!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Welchen Pfad durch
das erste Labyrinth wählst du?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Folge deiner Intuition!{{TAG:0008:0001:080000000800000008000000}}
Den blauen Pfad.
Den roten Pfad.
Den grünen Pfad.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Che sfortuna!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti sei impantanat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
in una palude di {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ti rimangono due labirinti.
Quale tracciato vuoi seguire
questa volta?{{TAG:0008:0001:0D0000000D0000000D000000}}
Il tracciato rosa...
Il tracciato nero...
Il tracciato bianco...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Eyvah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}} bataklığına saplandın!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Ama hâlâ 2 labirentin var.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}İkinci
labirentte hangi yolu seçeceksin?{{TAG:0008:0001:0D0000000D0000000D000000}}
Pembe yol.
Siyah yol.
Beyaz yol.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Vaya, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}qué mala suerte tienes{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Has perdido tu {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
y tienes que volver a la entrada.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Venga, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ahora vamos a por el
último laberinto. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡Buena suerte!{{TAG:0008:0001:120000001200000012000000}}
¡El camino amarillo!
¡El camino naranja!
¡El camino morado!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tu as perdu {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
et tu as dû revenir sur tes pas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bon,
dernière chance : quel chemin ?{{TAG:0008:0001:120000001200000012000000}}
Le jaune.
L'orange.
Le violet.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Wenn du auch diesmal daneben
liegst, kostet dich das einen Haufen
Sternis. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bist du mental vorbereitet?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also gut, ich wünsche dir Glück.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Es geht links entlang... {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Dann rechts...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und dann einmal mittendurch.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bu sefer kaybedersen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sana pahalıya
patlayacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Her iki sonuca da zihnen
hazır mısın? Umarım şansın döner.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Seçtiğin yol sola gidiyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sonra sağa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
sonra ortadan yana doğru geçiyor.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Wenn du auch diesmal daneben-
liegst, kostet dich das einen Haufen
Sternis. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bist du mental vorbereitet?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also gut, ich wünsche dir Glück.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Es geht links entlang... {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Wieder links...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
